step 7
add root: return answer
note root complexity: O(n)
expect code:
    # Complexity: O(n)
    answer = []
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        if i % 15 == 0:
            answer.append("FizzBuzz")
        elif i % 3 == 0:
            answer.append("Fizz")
        elif i % 5 == 0:
            answer.append("Buzz")
        else:
            answer.append(str(i))
    return answer
expect gaps none
